OL,3,GNEWSACrew honoured after 14 fishermen
OL,4,Arescued from stricken boat
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter almost 30 years of rescuing
OL,7,Fpeople up and down Ireland's coastline
OL,8,Ffrom helicopters, Jim O'Neill thought
OL,9,Fhe'd seen almost everything.
OL,11,FThat was until the call came in just
OL,12,Fbefore last Christmas.
OL,14,FThe French fishing vessel Fastnet, and
OL,15,Fits 14-strong crew, was stranded on
OL,16,Frocks in County Kerry, having suffered
OL,17,Fengine failure while leaving Dingle
OL,18,FHarbour.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
