OL,3,GNEWSACrew honoured after 14 fishermen
OL,4,Arescued from stricken boat
OL,5,
OL,6,FNear gale-force winds and strong
OL,7,FAtlantic waves had run it aground and
OL,8,Fwere threatening to capsize or break it
OL,9,Fapart, leaving the crew at the mercy of
OL,10,Fthe ocean.
